---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="bg-cosmic min-h-screen p-6 text-white">
    <article class="prose prose-invert mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        <strong>Last updated:</strong> September 14, 2026
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Loopdeck collects your email address when you create an account. Task titles you enter are stored so the product
        can show your backlog and today&apos;s focus.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
      <p>
        Email is used for sign-in and account recovery through our authentication provider. Task data is used only to
        provide the todo service to you.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Data is kept until you delete your account. When you delete your account, your tasks and profile are removed
        from our database.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can delete your account at any time from the dashboard. This removes your email, tasks, and related records.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact the project maintainer.</p>

      <p>
        <a href="/auth/signup">Back to sign up</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
